WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:03.003 --> 00:00:03.712
Emma?

00:00:04.546 --> 00:00:06.047
You gotta
 help me so that I can help you.

00:00:07.632 --> 00:00:09.592
Dad, why do I have to talk to
 you? You don't talk to me.

00:00:09.592 --> 00:00:12.220
It is my job to help
 keep you safe.

00:00:12.220 --> 00:00:13.805
Maybe you should help yourself. 

00:00:14.514 --> 00:00:17.267
It's like she's built
 this fortress around herself,

00:00:17.267 --> 00:00:18.893
so that nothing can hurt her. 

00:00:26.484 --> 00:00:27.235
Em?

00:00:27.444 --> 00:00:28.194
Em? 

00:00:28.194 --> 00:00:28.695
You're okay!

00:00:29.738 --> 00:00:30.280
Hi. 

00:00:30.363 --> 00:00:31.239
Are you okay?

00:00:31.239 --> 00:00:32.073
She's got a panic attack! 

00:00:32.073 --> 00:00:33.366
Look at me, look at me. 

00:00:33.366 --> 00:00:35.368
I know where you're at. 

00:00:37.203 --> 00:00:38.913
What did you say to her?

00:00:42.500 --> 00:00:43.501
Oh, God. 

00:00:43.501 --> 00:00:44.502
Hi. 

00:00:44.502 --> 00:00:46.963
I wanted to say sorry
 for wrecking your universe.

00:00:47.714 --> 00:00:50.216
You coming in to check on Emma
 was a very thoughtful gesture.

00:00:50.216 --> 00:00:51.760
I did hit you both with my car. 

00:00:51.760 --> 00:00:52.594
You did. 

00:00:52.594 --> 00:00:53.720
And I am planning on suing. 

00:00:55.680 --> 00:00:57.974
I find it very easy to be in 
your company. You know that?

00:00:57.974 --> 00:00:59.726
Yeah, it's been a while for me too.

00:01:02.353 --> 00:01:03.772
Why did you run away from me? 

00:01:03.772 --> 00:01:05.148
I'm a complicated person. 

00:01:05.148 --> 00:01:06.357
I've got baggage. 

00:01:07.192 --> 00:01:09.444
After the accident,
 when I was scared, 

00:01:09.444 --> 00:01:10.820
you said that
 you've been there too. 

00:01:10.820 --> 00:01:12.947
Oh, I have. A bunch of times. 

00:01:12.947 --> 00:01:15.742
- My life is a mess. 
- This is good.

00:01:18.078 --> 00:01:20.455
I've never shared this with anyone before.

00:01:26.252 --> 00:01:27.420
I'm not perfect either. 

00:01:27.420 --> 00:01:30.173
It felt like the universe
 was bringing us together.

00:01:30.381 --> 00:01:32.092
What if this 
happened for a reason? 

00:01:32.092 --> 00:01:35.053
How did your husband die?

00:01:36.596 --> 00:01:38.348
We've all got wolves in us.

00:01:38.890 --> 00:01:41.017
You just have to make sure
 you feed the right one. 

00:01:52.320 --> 00:01:53.321
This is me. 

00:01:54.114 --> 00:01:55.365
This is who I am.

